        "Tuning the test to the data, switching to one tail after seeing the direction, or resetting alpha from 0.05 to 0.10 when p lands at 0.07, converts honest inference into theatre. Power discussed only after a null result is the same move in reverse. In {S} answers, alpha, tails and hypotheses must all be fixed before the statistic is computed, and the conclusion must restate the level used.",
